  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3a">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:ICn">I Cn</ref> 3a</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Bete man ærest þone griðbryce into þære cyrican be þam þe seo dæd sy ⁊ be þam þe ðære cyricean mæð sy.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">In the first instance, amends for breach of its protection shall be made to the church, in accordance with the nature of the offence and also in proportion to the status of the church.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Bete man ærest þone griðbryce into þære cyrican, be þam þe seo dæd sy ⁊ be þam þe ðære cyricean mæð sy.</ab>
      </div>
